WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.657
The best visual depends on the question.

00:00:02.657 --> 00:00:08.952
Bar charts compare categories. Line charts emphasize change over time.

00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:15.362
Histograms show distributions. Box plots compare spread across groups.

00:00:15.362 --> 00:00:20.377
Scatter plots show relationships between two numeric variables.

00:00:20.377 --> 00:00:23.704
Tables are useful when exact values matter.

00:00:24.255 --> 00:00:27.707
Do not choose a chart because it looks impressive.

00:00:27.707 --> 00:00:32.525
Choose the form that makes the analytical question easiest to answer.
